    "writingTask": "Write a close reading of the original practice poem. Discuss personification, contrast and tone with brief textual evidence. Aim for two to three connected paragraphs within the writing box. Ask an adult to review evidence, reasoning, organisation and language. This is a short practice response, not a full examination essay, and is not automatically marked.",
