    "writingTask": "Draft a short academic report, then revise register, clause structure and any unsupported causal claims. Aim for two to three connected paragraphs within the writing box. Ask an adult to review evidence, reasoning, organisation and language. This is a short practice response, not a full examination essay, and is not automatically marked.",
    "scaffolding": {
      "FAL": "Read or listen twice. Discuss unfamiliar words with an adult, then use sentence frames before writing independently.",
      "HL": "Explain your evidence precisely. Extend your paragraph with connected details and revise for audience and purpose."
    }
